  mālābhihārati; Tāhaṃ bhagavato thūpe, sabbamevābhiropayiṃ.

+ ‘‘Uposathe cahaṃ gantvā, mālāgandhavilepanaṃ; Thūpasmiṃ abhiropesiṃ,
