1064.‘‘Phaladāyī phalaṃ vipulaṃ labhati, dadamujugatesu pasannamānaso;
So hi pamodati \[modati (sī. syā. pī.)\] saggagato tidive \[tattha
(ka.)\], anubhoti ca puññaphalaṃ

vipulaṃ.

1065.‘‘Tavevāhaṃ \[tathevāhaṃ (sī. syā. pī.)\] mahāmuni, adāsiṃ caturo
phale.

1066.‘‘Tasmā hi phalaṃ alameva dātuṃ, niccaṃ manussena sukhatthikena;
Dibbāni vā patthayatā sukhāni, manussasobhaggatamicchatā vā.

1067.‘‘Tena metādiso vaṇṇo…pe… Vaṇṇo ca me sabbadisā pabhāsatī''ti.

